{
    "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.CustomBlockManifest",
    "name": "Basket Affinity Matrix",
    "scriptFilename": "script.py",
    "language": "PYTHON",
    "executableVersion": null,
    "minVersions": [
        null
    ],
    "optionsVersion": 1,
    "apiVersion": "VERSION_0",
    "isResourceIntensiveScript": false,
    "showPartitioning": false,
    "icon": "data:image/png;base64,",
    "description": "Measures how often every pair of items is bought together (support, confidence, lift, Jaccard) from basket data, with each item's strongest partners.",
    "category": "Analytics",
    "subcategory": "Retail",
    "tags": [
        "market basket",
        "affinity",
        "lift",
        "cross-sell",
        "co-occurrence",
        "retail",
        "visokio-agents"
    ],
    "introductoryText": "Which products are bought together, and how much more often than chance? From transaction lines (one row per basket and item), the block measures **every pair** of the most common items:\n\n- **Baskets with both**, **support** (share of all baskets containing both)\n- **Confidence** in both directions: of baskets with A, the share that also have B (and the reverse)\n- **Lift**: how many times more often the pair occurs than if the items were independent (above 1 = bought together, below 1 = bought apart)\n- **Jaccard** similarity, and an association label\n\nThe item summary lists each item's baskets, support and its **strongest partners by lift**. Items are limited to the most frequent ones (50 by default) so the matrix stays readable; pairs below a minimum number of shared baskets are left out to avoid noisy lifts.\n\nA compact, all-pairs view for range, layout and cross-sell decisions; Omniscope's native Basket Analysis block produces association rules for larger item sets.",
    "dependencies": "",
    "options": [
        {
            "name": "basket_field",
            "title": "Basket / order ID",
            "description": "Identifies a basket: rows with the same value were bought together.",
            "groupTitle": "Data",
            "width": "ONE",
            "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.FieldCustomBlockPublicOption",
            "mandatory": true,
            "inputIndex": 0,
            "defaultValue": null,
            "fieldTypes": []
        },
        {
            "name": "item_field",
            "title": "Item / product",
            "description": "The item in each row, such as a product name or SKU.",
            "groupTitle": "Data",
            "width": "ONE",
            "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.FieldCustomBlockPublicOption",
            "mandatory": true,
            "inputIndex": 0,
            "defaultValue": null,
            "fieldTypes": []
        },
        {
            "name": "max_items",
            "title": "Most frequent items to include",
            "description": "Only this many of the most often bought items are paired, which keeps the output readable.",
            "groupTitle": "Filters",
            "width": "HALF",
            "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.IntegerCustomBlockPublicOption",
            "numMin": 2,
            "numMax": 2000,
            "mandatory": true,
            "defaultValue": 50,
            "showAsSlider": false
        },
        {
            "name": "min_item_baskets",
            "title": "Minimum baskets per item",
            "description": null,
            "groupTitle": "Filters",
            "width": "HALF",
            "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.IntegerCustomBlockPublicOption",
            "numMin": 1,
            "numMax": null,
            "mandatory": true,
            "defaultValue": 5,
            "showAsSlider": false
        },
        {
            "name": "min_pair_baskets",
            "title": "Minimum baskets per pair",
            "description": "Pairs seen together fewer times are left out.",
            "groupTitle": "Filters",
            "width": "HALF",
            "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.IntegerCustomBlockPublicOption",
            "numMin": 1,
            "numMax": null,
            "mandatory": true,
            "defaultValue": 3,
            "showAsSlider": false
        },
        {
            "name": "top_partners",
            "title": "Partners listed per item",
            "description": null,
            "groupTitle": "Filters",
            "width": "HALF",
            "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.IntegerCustomBlockPublicOption",
            "numMin": 1,
            "numMax": 20,
            "mandatory": true,
            "defaultValue": 3,
            "showAsSlider": false
        }
    ],
    "blockOutputs": [
        {
            "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.BlockOutputPublicOption",
            "id": "pairs",
            "label": "Pairs",
            "displayName": "Item pairs",
            "tooltip": "One row per item pair: baskets with both, support, confidence both ways, lift, Jaccard, association."
        },
        {
            "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.BlockOutputPublicOption",
            "id": "items",
            "label": "Items",
            "displayName": "Item summary",
            "tooltip": "Per item: baskets, support and strongest partners by lift."
        }
    ],
    "docker": {
        "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.DockerCustomBlockPublicOption",
        "customBaseImage": null,
        "useCustomBaseImage": false,
        "customSystemLibraries": null,
        "installVisokioRepLibraries": false
    },
    "designLock": false,
    "apiMode": "BATCH"
}
